Let me add my voice to the clamor. I finally got to the bottom of the Gnomish
Mines and found a pile of jewels and a luckstone. I mean, there are worse
fates, but is that it? Is there nothing else in the mines? (Though I must
admit the mall level is very, very, very cool, the rest of the mines tend
to be repetitive.) I seem to recall hearing that one of the vital artifacts
needed for later in the game is here, but I didn't find anything special.

ObHackStory: So Kei the Valkyrie was standing in the temple of Tyr in the
mall level. I decided on a lark to read one of my scrolls. Happened to be
a scroll of fire... oops. I didn't lose anything important, but the priestess
of Tyr happened to be standing right next to me and got caught in the fireball.
Double oops. Tyr gets kinda peeved, says some typical godlike thing along the
lines of "how dare you attack my servant" and pegs a lightning bolt at me.

The lightning bolt whizzes by you! -more-
The lightning bolt hits the priestess of Tyr!

Heh. I suppose even gods have off days.

